## Why this statement is a suite member

Cost tracking is the spine of every suite. A package without a ProjectID and
a funding statement cannot be accounted: no run, review, or carriage of this
suite can be charged, checked against a funding gate, or settled. The
reference suites carry this statement as data on the package's face; this
suite is identical to them in this respect by requirement, and this member
is that requirement's instrument.

The funding check gates use of this suite wherever a governed run consumes
it: a consumer checks the ProjectID against the funding registry, and the
statement above is what the check reads — declared as data, never inferred
from who built the package or who is holding it.
